{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Logging is disabled by default and no logs are generated when logging is disabled. When enabled, log are captured at levels corresponding to their importance. An error-level log may indicate why an Appcues experience failed to display. Debug-level logs contain much more granular information about the internal operation of the Appcues SDK."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Enable Logging","anchor":"Enable-Logging"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Logging is enabled via the configuration of your "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues"},{"type":"text","text":" instance. Call "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/Config\/logging(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with a value of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Viewing Logs","anchor":"Viewing-Logs"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once enabled, logs can be viewed several different ways:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Console","anchor":"Console"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Logs can be inspected using Console.app. All logs from the Appcues SDK are generated under the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.appcues.sdk"},{"type":"text","text":" subsystem and can be easily filtered via a search."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Xcode","anchor":"Xcode"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Log messages will appear in the Xcode console when running your app attached to the debugger."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Terminal","anchor":"Terminal"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug-level logs specific to the Appcues iOS SDK from a simulator can be streamed via a Terminal session:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["xcrun simctl spawn booted log stream --debug --predicate 'subsystem == \"com.appcues.sdk\"'"],"syntax":"sh","type":"codeListing"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit","doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Appcues for iOS can be configured to enable logging via Apple’s unified logging system, ensuring logs are accessible, performant, and private."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Debugging","doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/debug()","doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/filterAndHandle(_:)","doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/didHandleURL(_:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Debugging","anchor":"Debugging"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Logging","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/appcueskit\/logging"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"AppcuesKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Working with Logs"},"references":{"doc://com.appcues.sdk/documentation/AppcuesKit/Appcues/Config/logging(_:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the logging status for the configuration."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/appcueskit\/appcues\/config\/logging(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/Config\/logging(_:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"logging"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"ty